# 🌎 English (short version)

Each **release** of this public record is a coherent set of documents whose exact
state is fixed by SHA-256 hashes (see [`HASH_POLICY.md`](./HASH_POLICY.md) and
[`SHA256_REGISTRY.md`](./SHA256_REGISTRY.md)). A **public snapshot** is the set of
public documents at a point in time, identified by its `CHANGELOG` version, its date
(Brasília time), and the hash registry then in force; snapshots carry no
implementation and, for the benchmark, reference only **aggregate** results and,
where applicable, the run's **master hash**. Versioning of the **public record** is
independent of the **work's** own (unpublished) versioning. Historical evidence is
**preserved, not overwritten**: prior versions remain in history, corrections are new
CHANGELOG entries, and a later measurement (e.g., v0.3) is presented as a **new
measurement** without erasing the earlier one — keeping public priority and
traceability verifiable over time.

